  "reviewPoints": [
    "Age 17–60 and special guardian condition for applicants aged 17 but under 18.",
    "Teaching language explicitly Chinese in the application filter, not inferred from learning Chinese.",
    "No stated minimum HSK or academic qualification; arrival placement is not an exemption guarantee.",
    "One semester exact EN/ZH duration text; no guessed month duration and no level-based route multiplication.",
    "Spring dates are tentative; application year is grounded in the dated October 2026 notice and explicit spring 2027 guide.",
    "Tuition 10500/semester is reference with final finance pricing reservation; allowOfficialReferenceTuition is explicit and separate from the actual tuitionStatus proof.",
    "Application fee 400 and materials are not returnable.",
    "Ordinary passport must cover study; no renewal/number change until registration or electronic visa form becomes invalid.",
    "JW202 threshold 180 days or longer; DQ below 180; arrival advice and visa help only after registration are preserved.",
    "Housing is self-arranged with nearby information for reference, without a room or price guarantee.",
    "Annual 21000 option is retained only as brochure context in notes."
  ],
